@page "/"

<PageTitle>EM Field Calculator</PageTitle>

<h1>Electromagnetic Field Calculator</h1>

<p class="lead">
    This application calculates the electric and magnetic field around an overhead
    power line using a quasi-static 2-D model.
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Enter conductor geometry and electrical data on the <a href="/calculator">Calculator</a> page.</li>
    <li>Choose a single observation point or a horizontal profile.</li>
    <li>Run the field calculation or the exposure dose calculation.</li>
</ul>

<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/calculator">Open Calculator</a>

